 sh test/upgrade/check_rails_artifacts.sh
+# Include the actual, separately bundled Rails 6.1 rollback checkout:
+sh test/upgrade/check_rails_artifacts.sh /path/to/deployed-rails-61
 ```
 
-The same probe can be run against the previous Ruby 3.0 checkout using its
-original bundle and an absolute path to the script. Check both directions
-between the original release and this Rails 6.1 release. Use only test data
-and a common test secret, never production cookies or tokens.
+Separate test processes exchange encrypted sessions (including nested
+symbol keys), signed cookies and expiring mail links. The probe checks both
+directions, and rejects tampered, expired and wrong-purpose mail tokens.
+Use only test data and the same test secret, never production artifacts.
